  "instructions": [
    "In a copper pot, warm the milk over low heat.",
    "Add the honey and whisk until dissolved.",
    "Gradually add the Irish oatmeal and cook for 5 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the diced corn and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and stir in the dark chocolate chips until melted.",
    "Add the cinnamon and salt, and mix well.",
    "Let the porridge rest for 2 minutes before serving."
